1
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:12,500
Look at the colors in this wee one, Mara.

2
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,200
It's bonnie. D'ye think it came frae far away?

3
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:22,100
Everything washes up here in the end.

4
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,000
The water feels strange today, Elena.

5
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:22,000
It's just the changing season, och.

6
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,000
Ma, help!

7
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:37,000
I've got ye! Dinnae go near the edge again!

8
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:12,000
The paths are crumbling, Petra. Someone'll get hurt.

9
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:17,000
Some paths are meant to be forgotten in the glen, Elena.

10
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:22,000
Not when my wee bairn's life is at risk.

11
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:17,000
Ye tie knots like a blind seagull, Mara.

12
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:20,000
At least I catch more fish than you, och.

13
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:24,000
Och. That hurts.

14
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:12,000
Ye shouldn't be here, Elena. The light only guides ships away.

15
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:17,000
Ye've been watchin' us for years. Why?

16
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:22,000
Some ties cannae be severed, no matter how deep the water gets.

17
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:12,000
The Watcher is real, Kade. I've seen the shadow.

18
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:17,000
It's just stories to keep the bairns in bed.

19
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:22,000
What is this place?

20
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:32,000
These journals... they have my mither's name.
